WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.033 --> 00:00:03.259
[Clock ticking]

00:00:04.586 --> 00:00:06.808
VOICE
Hello, and welcome to Staying Awake.

00:00:06.859 --> 00:00:09.098
STEVEN
I have a sleeping disorder.

00:00:09.149 --> 00:00:14.302
I can't tell the difference
between my waking life and dreams.

00:00:14.352 --> 00:00:16.821
VOICE
Hello, and welcome to Staying Awake...

00:00:16.872 --> 00:00:18.965
[Voice echoes, repeats]

00:00:19.016 --> 00:00:21.016
STEVEN
[Screaming]

00:00:23.951 --> 00:00:25.116
♫ Day and night ♫

00:00:28.099 --> 00:00:29.580
♫ In my mind ♫

00:00:29.631 --> 00:00:30.678
STEVEN
I'm losing it.

00:00:32.427 --> 00:00:33.333
♫ Day and night ♫

00:00:33.384 --> 00:00:34.618
DONNA
Real catch you are.

00:00:35.279 --> 00:00:38.057
You're bloody useless, Stevie.

00:00:38.107 --> 00:00:39.224
STEVEN
It's Steven.

00:00:40.005 --> 00:00:40.874
DONNA
[Laughs]

00:00:41.287 --> 00:00:42.654
STEVEN
I can't tell the difference...

00:00:43.795 --> 00:00:45.595
...between life and dreams.

00:00:46.115 --> 00:00:46.803
[Steven gasps]

00:00:48.428 --> 00:00:49.198
[Screams]
[Elevator dings]

00:00:49.248 --> 00:00:50.384
ELDERLY WOMAN
Thank you.

00:00:51.506 --> 00:00:53.053
STEVEN
Lost a contact lens.

00:00:53.545 --> 00:00:54.862
ELDERLY WOMAN
Hope you find it.

00:00:54.912 --> 00:00:55.889
STEVEN
Thanks.

00:00:58.068 --> 00:00:59.476
[Phone ringing]

00:01:00.271 --> 00:01:01.471
♫ Hold the phone ♫

00:01:02.115 --> 00:01:03.315
♫ Hold the phone ♫

00:01:03.990 --> 00:01:05.457
♫ Now hold the phone ♫

00:01:06.895 --> 00:01:07.635
STEVEN
Yeah?

00:01:07.685 --> 00:01:09.302
LAYLA
Oh my God, you're alive.

00:01:09.353 --> 00:01:11.029
What's wrong with you, Marc?

00:01:11.785 --> 00:01:13.763
STEVEN
Why did you call me Marc?

00:01:13.835 --> 00:01:15.242
♫ Day and night ♫

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:16.651
ARTHUR HARROW
It must be very difficult.

00:01:18.182 --> 00:01:19.994
The voices in your head.

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:22.250
MARC
Shut! Up!

00:01:23.050 --> 00:01:24.310
ARTHUR HARROW
There's chaos in you.

00:01:30.862 --> 00:01:31.842
[Screaming]

00:01:35.002 --> 00:01:37.002
ARTHUR HARROW
Embrace the chaos.

00:01:47.362 --> 00:01:48.713
♫ Day and night ♫

00:01:53.328 --> 00:01:55.507
♫ At, at, at night ♫

